{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121590","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121590/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121590/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121590/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121590","id":4934644299,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70It20","number":121590,"title":"Only log haptic engine vibration error when one actually occurred","user":{"login":"andresmonc","id":41450290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDUwMjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41450290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc","html_url":"https://github.com/andresmonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresmonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-21T01:56:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T21:20:45Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T07:56:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121590","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121590.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121590.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"On iOS, `AppleEmbedded::vibrate_haptic_engine` calls `NSLog(@\"Could not vibrate using haptic engine: %@\", error);` unconditionally after starting the haptic pattern player. Since `error` is nil on success, every successful `Input.vibrate_handheld()` call spams the console with:\r\n\r\n```\r\nCould not vibrate using haptic engine: (null)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR guards the log with an `if (error)` check (and initializes `error` to nil), matching the error handling style of the other haptic engine methods in the same file (`get_haptic_engine_instance`, `start_haptic_engine`, `stop_haptic_engine`).\r\n\r\nNo behavior change other than removing the misleading log line on success.\r\n\r\nNoticed while running a game in debugger in Xcode on iPhone 15 Pro.  \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.g